# Hybrid Cloud DNS Options for Amazon VPC AWS Whitepaper

> The Domain Name System (DNS) is a foundational element of the internet that underpins many services offered by Amazon Web Services (AWS). Amazon Route 53 Resolver provides resolution with DNS for public domain names, Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (Amazon VPC), and Amazon Route 53 private hosted zones (PHZs). This whitepaper includes solutions and considerations for advanced DNS architectures to help customers who have workloads with unique DNS requirements, or on-premises resources that require DNS resolution between on-premises data centers and Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2) instances in Amazon VPCs.

